# experimentation is not the same as optimization

Those who know me have heard me repeat this many times over, but it's important to do so again: the word "experimentation" is used too loosely and in doing so it captures two incompatible ideas. experimentation ought to be about shedding your biases  and leveraging the appratus of experimental design to answer some question about the world as it is. unfortunately, the word experimentation is often also used to describe the activity of "Trying things out" in a more ad hoc way.

